      "words": 9
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Yes,” I breathe, and his mouth is on mine in a heartbeat. He doesn’t need to say anything else. He has said enough",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9378
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I’ve been yours since that first night at the hotel,” he says simply, and damn if my heart doesn’t stumble",
          "ok": true,
